WEBVTT

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:15.240
What an amazing sight.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:21.540
Truly the showroom of Yajima Trading, which makes the new Plavsky particle

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:24.920
and is reponsible for developing the battle system.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:26.710
Lieutenant Ral!

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.210
Oh!

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:32.590
It's been a long time.

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:34.050
Nils Niel...

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:35.640
Oops. Now you're...

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.720
Yajima Nils, right?

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.390
Is your wife doing well?

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:46.850
She's happily flying around the world as a director of Yajima Trading.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:52.650
You're not going to enter the Gunpla Battle Championship anymore?

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:56.200
I'm the chief engineer of Yajima Engineering.

00:00:56.530 --> 00:01:01.580
I know everything about the new Plavsky particles and battle system.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:06.250
It wouldn't be fair for me to participate in the championship.

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:09.670
It's a pity. You were so talented.

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:14.260
The reason you came here today surely wasn't to invite me.

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:20.390
I'm aware that the kids you're teaching have made it to the national tournament.

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:24.890
I'm very interested in how the Blue Giant coached his team.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:27.850
I didn't do anything.

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:31.270
They won with their own strength.

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:34.440
Didn't you bring them with you?

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:38.160
They're in the middle of end-of-term exams.

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:41.330
When they're over, summer vacation begins.

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:45.910
The national tournament is held at the beginning of August.

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:48.880
Shouldn't they go to a training camp before then?

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:50.920
Lieutenent, you don't--

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:53.460
I want to ask you exactly that.

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:56.090
You want to take them to the Labs?

00:01:56.300 --> 00:02:01.470
But, if anything goes wrong, it's possible they'll collapse before the national tournament...

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:04.560
I think it's worth the risk.

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:10.020
I think it'll be worthwhile for them to take it on.

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:17.400
You're seriously aiming to win it.             The national championship.

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:20.780
There's no fighter who doesn't hope for that.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:03.010
<b>It's not anime.</b>

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:06.260
<i>It's the real thing.</i>

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:09.560
<b>It's not anime.</b>

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:12.850
<i>Off to the Nationals.</i>

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:16.440
Mr. Ral, it's a good idea to go to a training camp, but...

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:20.650
there aren't many getaways where we can use a battle system.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.860
Don't worry, Yuuma.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:28.280
The place we're going has the industry's top battle facility.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.370
The industry's top...?

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:31.950
Could it be...

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.000
<b>It's not anime.</b>

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.210
Shut up!

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:38.500
Wow, what's that?

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:43.090
That's our training camp.

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:46.180
Also known as the Nielsen Labs.

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.480
I-It's huge!

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:00.150
Guys.

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:02.570
Come this way.

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:07.740
The Nielsen Labs not only have research facilities,

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:10.410
but also a cutting-edge Gunpla workshop,

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:16.290
and a state-of-the-art battle room used by world-famous fighters.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.670
This is it!

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:22.710
Wow.

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:25.840
So many battle systems of the latest model!

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:30.760
Using the facilities here, we'll enchance your Gunpla control techniques.

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:35.310
It's the perfect place to train, don't you think?

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:36.890
I sure do.

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:45.860
Someone's using it.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:54.450
In simulation mode?

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:53.100
Wow, they're good.

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:55.930
A 06R type? Cool choice.

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:57.810
Their teamwork is very good, too.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:00.980
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:12.870
That level of fatigue...

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:16.450
How long have they been training?

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:21.540
Who are you?

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:25.000
Have you come here for training camp?

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:26.710
Yes, that's right.

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:29.010
Umm, Nice to meet you.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:33.140
We'll be representing West Tokyo in the national tournament.

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:35.890
We're team Try Fighters from Seiho Academy.

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:37.560
Seiho...?

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:40.180
Never heard of it.

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:42.900
Uzuki, how about you?

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:44.020
Nope.

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:47.150
This is our first time entering the national tournament.

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:48.280
Pleased to meet you!

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:49.570
Your first time?

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:59.830
Hey, what's going on here?

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:04.420
These labs have really fallen if they're letting newbies in.

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.250
What do you mean?

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:09.380
You don't seem to know, so I'll tell you.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:13.470
These labs are only for use by regular national tournament teams!

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:16.510
They're not a place where upstart teams can come.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:21.350
There's too much difference in ability, so it won't be useful practice.

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:23.730
In other words, you guys are in the way.

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:26.270
Pack your bags and go home!

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:29.230
So you think you're strong?

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:30.320
Huh!?

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.900
You saw our mock battle, right?

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:36.070
You still don't know how great we are?

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:39.990
People who say that they're great

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:45.040
are just bluffing to make themselves look big to other people.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:50.500
The really great people do great things without any fuss.

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:52.550
They don't need to boast.

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:54.430
That's my master's teaching.

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:56.300
You're saying that we're small fry?

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.050
You brat!

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:58.890
I'm Kamiki Sekai.

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:02.180
How impertinent you are.

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:05.690
How about hand-to-hand instead of Gunpla Battle?

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:07.270
Bring it on!

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:09.440
You know martial arts?

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:11.360
I don't have to answer you.

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:13.030
So, what'll it be?

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:15.150
Do you want to or not?

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:17.070
Stop it, Sekai!

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:20.240
Really, you make enemies everywhere you go.

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:22.120
Mr. Ral, please stop this.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:24.960
I reject violence.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:27.000
<i>Then please stop it at once!</i>

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.000
What are you doing!?

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:35.800
Do you want to stir up a fight and get suspended?

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:37.550
Matsunaga!

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:38.970
S-Sorry...

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:44.390
I'm sorry. My team members are hot-blooded.

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:45.600
And you are?

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:48.310
We're from the Gabai Institute, representing Kagoshima.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:51.230
I'm Matsunaga, the leader of team White Wolf.

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:52.400
And you?

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:56.820
We're from Seiho Academy, representing West Tokyo. We're team Try Fighters.

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:58.320
West Tokyo?

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:01.240
So you beat the Miyazato Institute.

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:03.660
You know the Miyazato Institute?

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:05.450
Of course.

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:10.080
In last year's national tournament, we're the ones who smashed them to bits.

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:10.670
Huh?

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:12.670
They were weak, right?

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:13.500
Yeah.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:15.590
Matsunaga, you said?

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:19.640
Is it only your team that's training here?

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:23.100
I heard Toritsu Academy is coming today.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:29.270
Oh, Toritsu Academy has entered the national tournament 3 years in a row.

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:32.400
Heh, what's so special about 3 years in a row?

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:34.440
We're 4 years in a row!

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:35.530
Yeah!

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:36.940
That's cool.

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:38.950
So how many times have you won?

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:41.530
You brat, are you being sarcastic?

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:43.780
The Gunpla Academy won, of course.

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:47.710
Gunpla Academy? What's that?

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.250
Don't you know?

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:51.380
You guys really are amateurs.

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.040
I know it.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.960
I know it too, of course.

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:56.170
What is it?

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.590
The private Gunpla Academy.

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:02.680
The strongest team, dominating the nationals for 6 years in a row.

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:09.100
That school was incorporated from a previous Gunpla Academy which was owned by PPSE.

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:17.150
<i>A great builder named Allan Adams, who was PPSE's chief engineer, is the team coach.</i>

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:23.490
<i>Its members are gathered from all over the country, and they're all powerful fighters.</i>

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:28.120
To explain it to a dunce like you,

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:32.630
it's a school that was created to win Gunpla Battle Championship.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:35.340
Wow, I never knew there was such a strong competitor.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:36.300
How interesting!

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:40.670
So if we can beat them, it means we'll be champions!

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:43.220
Hey, is this guy nust?

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.470
He wants to beat the Gunpla Academy!

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:48.140
And you guys don't?

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:49.430
Of course, we do!

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:51.480
We're saying it's impossible for you!

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:53.850
You never know unless you try.

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:56.110
That's right. Let's try then.

00:11:56.110 --> 00:12:01.320
We came all the way to the Nielsen Labs.                 Could we have a practice match?

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:06.120
If it's okay to crush that kid's pride.

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:07.200
What did you say?

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.200
Sekai!

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:09.620
Go ahead.

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:13.460
Let's battle here in one hour. Is that okay?

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.130
I'll accept it.

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.680
What're you doing, Sekai?

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:32.390
We're late.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:35.440
I can't find my Build Burning...

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:37.730
How could that happen?

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:39.230
Find it immediately!

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:40.860
Yuu, help him!

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:47.320
Man, I didn't expect it to be buried in candy.

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:51.580
I hate people who treat their Gunpla so carelessly.

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:52.830
My bad.

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:55.870
Don't apologize to me, Tell it to the Build Burning!

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:57.580
Just hurry up!

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:01.920
I'm sorry we're late, Mr. Ral.

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:05.550
Mr. Ral?

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.180
The battle system is active?

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:11.430
That's...

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.780
Th-This is impossible...

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:32.910
The Gabai Institute...

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:36.330
Our White Wolf team...

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:39.960
Defeated by a single Gunpla.

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:42.250
What did he say?

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.590
They lost three-to-one.

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:46.760
Who in the world is it?

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:56.310
Th-That's...

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:06.740
That Gunpla...!

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:33.720
You weren't worth fighting at all.

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:36.560
You guys are going to the national tournament, huh?

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:41.560
Better not. You'll just be humiliated.

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:45.900
What? An intervention?

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.080
I found you!

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:51.180
There's no doubt.

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:53.370
You're the one from back then!

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:00.240
Yuuma!

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:01.120
What's he doing?

00:15:01.740 --> 00:15:06.380
Challenging me to a one-on-one match. You have guts.

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:14.550
I came back to Gunpla Battle to defeat you!

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:17.600
To get back what I had lost!

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:20.470
<i>Let me make a real apology.</i>

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:27.070
<i>I'm sorry that I broke my promise to you, and grew apart from Gunpla Battle.</i>

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:29.370
<i>The reason I became like that...</i>

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:33.380
<i>It's because of a battle that I played 2 years ago.</i>

00:15:34.690 --> 00:15:38.110
Could that fighter be Yuu's...

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:39.660
What is it?

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:41.690
I see...

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:44.630
Yuuma's nemesis is...

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:47.580
Is this fate?

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:51.740
So who are you, anyway?

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:53.080
I'm Kousaka Yuuma!

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:59.890
Did you really learn to build from the former world champ?

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:03.810
Are you really the favorite to win the regional qualifiers?

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:09.110
You have no talent...

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:11.920
for Gunpla Battle.

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:16.680
I won't let you say you've forgotten our battle two years ago!

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:18.910
Two years ago?

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:21.700
I'm battling all year round.

00:16:21.970 --> 00:16:23.920
Sorry, but I don't remember you!

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:24.870
What!?

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:26.490
What a selfish guy.

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:31.260
Two years ago, you suddenly challenged me to battle, without telling me your name!

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:32.720
It's Adou.

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:34.850
Adou Saga.

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:37.390
Stop yipping and howling.

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:39.210
The only howling...

00:16:41.740 --> 00:16:43.710
should come from my fangs!

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:47.050
Darn.

00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:17.350
What!?

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:22.930
For those two years, I've been rehearsing in my mind how to deal with your attacks!

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:24.640
How hard-working of you.

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:30.150
Impossible!

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:32.180
Fangs can't do that!

00:17:32.180 --> 00:17:34.440
They're specially made!

00:17:40.860 --> 00:17:41.710
N-No way.

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:46.810
My Lightning...

00:17:49.090 --> 00:17:52.000
The Gunpla I put my all into.

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:57.380
Two years of yearnings.

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:01.420
This...

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:03.760
This doesn't...

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:11.840
This doesn't reach him at all...?

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:17.020
Jigen Haoh style!

00:18:20.150 --> 00:18:22.810
<i>Seiso-Geri: Holy Spear Kick</i>

00:18:20.150 --> 00:18:22.810
Seiso-Geri!

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:24.930
Sekai!

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:27.520
And Fumina!

00:18:27.900 --> 00:18:29.080
Yuu, are you alright!?

00:18:30.070 --> 00:18:31.630
Hold on, Yuuma!

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:33.550
Are you his comrades?

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:38.440
This time, I'll be your opponent!

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:41.850
Jigen Haoh style!

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:43.010
That technique?

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:45.940
<i>Seiken-Zuki: Holy Fist Punch</i>

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:45.940
Seiken-Zuki!

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:47.640
He dodged it!?

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:49.770
It's the same as Junya's!

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:51.290
Fangs!

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:55.640
Jigen Haoh style!

00:18:55.920 --> 00:18:58.830
<i>Senpu Tatsumaki-Geri: Whirlwind Spinning Kick</i>

00:18:55.920 --> 00:18:58.830
Senpu Tatsumaki-Geri!

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:05.970
I want to say "not bad," but...

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:10.010
What!?

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:14.690
I misjudged it?

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:16.190
Sekai!

00:19:16.190 --> 00:19:17.810
Hoshino, from above!

00:19:17.810 --> 00:19:18.840
I know that!

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:22.140
Separate!

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.060
Sekai!

00:19:33.140 --> 00:19:36.530
Winning Knuckle!

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:40.350
An amusing Gunpla.

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:42.210
Let's go, Build Burning!

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:49.500
Jigen Haoh style!

00:19:53.280 --> 00:19:57.440
Ryusei Rasen-Ken!

00:19:53.280 --> 00:19:57.440
<i>Ryusei Rasen-Ken: Meteor Spiral Fist</i>

00:19:59.770 --> 00:20:01.870
I'll finish all of this.

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:04.810
This is...

00:20:10.030 --> 00:20:14.360
Dead End Finger!

00:20:37.050 --> 00:20:38.160
Sekai!

00:20:42.190 --> 00:20:42.910
That is...

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:44.930
Adou Saga.

00:20:45.770 --> 00:20:48.550
The machine of a Gunpla Academy regular member.

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:53.940
So that's the ability of an absolute champion.

00:20:56.240 --> 00:20:59.060
My Build Burning...

00:20:59.710 --> 00:21:01.180
The Jigen Haoh style...

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:04.530
That was a good fist.

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:06.950
But...

00:21:07.730 --> 00:21:09.770
It still wasn't enough.

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:11.000
I...

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:12.880
I want...

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:15.000
N-No!

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:19.750
I want a much stronger one!

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:22.130
Reinforcements?

00:21:40.830 --> 00:21:41.690
Th-That's...

00:21:43.350 --> 00:21:44.650
That machine...

00:21:45.710 --> 00:21:47.450
A crimson mobile suit.

00:21:48.050 --> 00:21:49.980
That's the legendary...

00:21:50.570 --> 00:21:51.740
Gunpla.

00:21:53.100 --> 00:21:55.720
Perfect Gundam III...

00:22:01.840 --> 00:22:03.900
Red Warrior!

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:43.800
He intervened in a battle among students.

00:23:44.550 --> 00:23:46.270
He's such a prankster.

00:23:47.010 --> 00:23:49.750
Watching the battle got your blood boiling, eh?

00:23:49.770 --> 00:23:50.420
Tatsuya.

00:23:51.440 --> 00:23:52.000
No...

00:23:52.600 --> 00:23:53.290
Master.

00:23:54.350 --> 00:23:57.520
Master Kawaguchi the Third.

00:24:00.700 --> 00:24:02.330
Having our existence belittled,

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:04.340
we realize our weakness.

00:24:04.600 --> 00:24:06.800
Next Episode, "To Fly To the Future."

00:24:07.040 --> 00:24:09.460
Even so, we'll keep moving forward!
